WEBVTT

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:01.296
It feels value-laden.

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:04.160
It hurts my body because the weight
represents so much.

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.856
But we're going to talk about it

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:09.136
and invite you into
an inside conversation today

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:12.360
because it is necessary,
and because we need you.

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:16.336
VG: Each night,
before the first day of school,

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.016
my grandmother
would sit me next to the stove

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:22.856
and with expert precision
use a hot comb to press my hair.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.376
My grandmother was legendary, big, loud.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.336
She filled up a room with laughter
and oftentimes curse words.

00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:31.336
She cooked a mean peach cobbler,